    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play arcade games in large or mini screen mode and enjoy the sight of sea creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Bricks Breaker</strong>: Break bricks with a ball and reach level 20. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pong Velocity</strong>: Defeat the computer even as the ball speeds up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Tetrominos</strong>: Arrange geometric shapes to clear lines. How far can you go? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Snake</strong>: The classic snake game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pong Twist</strong>: Overcome challenges in at least five levels to reach the final stage and face the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ski</strong>: Go as far as possible while avoiding being eaten by a yeti.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Penalty</strong>: Score goals while solving math challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fish are watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.poster.avif?t=1742834154\" width=584 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.webm?t=1742834154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.mp4?t=1742834154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play arcade games in large or mini screen mode and enjoy the sight of sea creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Bricks Breaker</strong>: Break bricks with a ball and reach level 20. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pong Velocity</strong>: Defeat the computer even as the ball speeds up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Tetrominos</strong>: Arrange geometric shapes to clear lines. How far can you go? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Snake</strong>: The classic snake game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pong Twist</strong>: Overcome challenges in at least five levels to reach the final stage and face the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ski</strong>: Go as far as possible while avoiding being eaten by a yeti.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Penalty</strong>: Score goals while solving math challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fish are watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.poster.avif?t=1742834154\" width=584 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.webm?t=1742834154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/523aa3f55bafb7003efd8e26e45ed7e5.mp4?t=1742834154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
